x
> lib32-recipe-sysroot/usr/include/asm/byteorder-32.h
> lib32-recipe-sysroot/usr/include/asm/sigcontext-32.h
> ...
>=20
> When gcc-cross-canadian-arm is built, the actual files get copied to
